WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.258
For years, Naina sang only when nobody was
listening.

2
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:10.617
Between work, meals, and everyone else's
dreams, her own voice grew quiet.

3
00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:17.607
One evening, she records a little song. Nearly
deletes it. Then shares it on iAdMe.

4
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:24.614
A musician nearby stops scrolling. Not because
it's perfect. Because it feels like something.

5
00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:31.003
He sends a message. We're singing together
this Sunday. Would you join us?

6
00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:38.024
She almost says no. Then takes out the
notebook she hasn't carried in years.

7
00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:45.177
It's a small gathering. A few chairs. And
people who make room for her voice.

8
00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:54.606
That evening, she isn't singing to an empty
room anymore. Someone nearby was waiting to
listen.

9
00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:59.457
iAdMe. Find your people. Share your story.
